+## 12. Stale-Proof Policy
+Evidence is fresh only when the build SHA is current or the product surface has not changed since collection and it is less than 14 days old. Stale or unpinned evidence cannot support UX-RC, SHIP-RC, or SHIP.
+## 13. Surrogate Proof Rule
+Any report using §3 anti-proof must label the affected claim “Surrogate Proof,” cannot claim UX-RC or higher for that claim, and must name the missing valid artifact and rerun path.
